flowchart TB
  subgraph CPU["CPU physical geometry and deterministic ownership"]
    BOARD["Prepared static domain boundaries"] --> PIX["0.05 mm logical index; sparse rich cell records"]
    PIX --> REC["Record: distance, conservative cell bound, flags, nearest primitive, overlap span"]
    REC -. references .-> BVH["Immutable exact primitive pool and BVH"]
    LIVE["Dynamic route owners: net, layer, endpoints, radius, source resource"] --> OWN["Immutable owner BVH per occupancy snapshot"]
    OWN --> QUERY["Layer-aware expanded-envelope candidate query"]
    QUERY --> EXACT["Exact segment distance and resolved pairwise net clearance"]
    RULES["Owner net membership and applicable pairwise rules"] --> EXACT
    EXACT --> CLASS{"Physical interpretation"}
    CLASS -->|Incompatible allocated envelopes| CONFLICT["Attributed shadow conflict"]
    CLASS -->|Shared corridor with estimated capacity| PENDING["Packing unresolved; no false legality claim"]
    PENDING --> PROOF["Regional lane and continuous-copper proof"]
    PROOF -->|Complete legal scene| RESOLVE["Discharge obligations"]
    PROOF -->|Measured infeasibility| CONFLICT
    RIP["Lay or rip up copper"] --> INV["Invalidate affected owner snapshot and certificates"]
    INV --> OWN
    BVH --> FIELD["Physical walkability and boundary-distance fields"]
  end
  subgraph GPU["Optional bounded GPU acceleration and resident reusable buffers"]
    MASK["Shared immutable walkability-mask lease"] --> HEIGHT["Height evolution and flow kernels"]
    MASK --> HYD["Hydraulic / routing compute consumers"]
    SCREEN["Conservative intersection screening batches"]
    XPBD["GPU XPBD when available; CPU fallback"]
  end
  FIELD --> MASK
  PRESS["Mutable history, pressure and success preferences"] --> HEIGHT
  HEIGHT --> PORT["Route discovery and alternatives"]
  SCREEN --> CHECK["Exact CPU checks for survivors"]
  XPBD --> AVBD["Optional CPU AVBD refinement after successful XPBD; retain only improvement"]
  CHECK --> PROOF
  AVBD --> PROOF
  BUDGET["One shared CPU worker budget; bounded GPU batches"] -. bounds .-> QUERY
  BUDGET -. bounds .-> PROOF
  BUDGET -. bounds .-> SCREEN
  BUDGET -. bounds .-> XPBD
